{"id":"4033dacb4f25ad78","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-halting-set-isomorphisms.md","title":"K、二元停机集与非空域指标可计算同构","display":"thm-halting-set-isomorphisms — K、二元停机集与非空域指标可计算同构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-halting-set-isomorphisms","aliases":["20-thm-halting-set-isomorphisms"],"display":"thm-halting-set-isomorphisms — K、二元停机集与非空域指标可计算同构","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.4.2；Exercise 1.6.22","source_printed_pages":[38,18],"source_pdf_pages":[74,54],"depends_on":["[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-halt]]","[[20-df-k1-con]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-halting-set-isomorphisms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-halting-set-isomorphisms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-halting-set-isomorphisms — K、二元停机集与非空域指标可计算同构"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.4.2；Exercise 1.6.22"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>38</span><span>18</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>74</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" href=\"?note=2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" title=\"20-df-halt\">20-df-halt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6846dcaa8e4f345a\" href=\"?note=6846dcaa8e4f345a\" title=\"20-df-k1-con\">20-df-k1-con</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" href=\"?note=50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" title=\"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism\">20-thm-myhill-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\}\">\\(H=\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\}\\)</span> 为本目录的二元停机集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" href=\"?note=2f9e8362ed1dce1d\" title=\"20-df-halt\">20-df-halt</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6846dcaa8e4f345a\" href=\"?note=6846dcaa8e4f345a\" title=\"20-df-k1-con\">20-df-k1-con</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" href=\"?note=50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" title=\"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism\">20-thm-myhill-isomorphism</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}set\\text{-}isomorphisms}\\vdash\nK\\equiv_1 H\\equiv_1\\mathrm K_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}set\\text{-}isomorphisms}\\vdash\nK\\equiv_1 H\\equiv_1\\mathrm K_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三者 c.e.。H 对任意 W_e 的单射归约为 x↦〈e,x〉。对 K₁，从给定 W_e 的成员候选 x 统一编译程序：等待 x∈W_e，再在全部输入上停止；未进入时恒发散。padding 使 x 到索引单射。K 的 1 完全性由已有定理给出。故三者两两 1 等价，Myhill 定理给可计算置换同构。本目录 H 的配对顺序为程序、输入，原书 K₀ 为输入、程序，交换配对坐标是可计算置换。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.4.2；Exercise 1.6.22；印刷页 38, 18；PDF 第 74, 54 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-halt","status":"resolved","id":"2f9e8362ed1dce1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-halt]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-k1-con","status":"resolved","id":"6846dcaa8e4f345a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-k1-con]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","t